OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fgradually clearing to leave a rather
OL,7,Fcloudy day. Bright or even sunny
OL,8,Fspells in the east through the morning
OL,9,Fbut turning damp through the afternoon
OL,10,Fwith a band of light rain arriving
OL,11,Ffrom the northwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLight rain slowly clearing
OL,14,Ftowards the southeast this evening,
OL,15,Fleaving a mostly clear and dry night
OL,16,Fto come, leading to mist and fog
OL,17,Fpatches. Chilly, especially in rural
OL,18,Fspots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
