OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry day to come with sunny
OL,6,Fspells which could turn hazy at times
OL,7,Fwith high cloud. Light winds with
OL,8,Ftemperatures a little above average
OL,9,Ffor September.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,12,Fbreezier on Sunday with rain edging
OL,13,Feastwards, heavy in places later. Fine
OL,14,Fon Monday with some sunshine, but
OL,15,Fturning wet and windy again on
OL,16,FTuesday. Temperatures staying above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
